Black sedans are frequently used by the [[Suits]] all over the globe.

A grey sedan was used to transport [[DeFoe]] and [[Grier]] prior to their return to [[Prague]] as they followed the Huntik team in their quest to find [[Jodis Lore]]'s notes. {{Source|The Casterwill Client}}

A white sedan was used to personally transport [[Wilder]] to the [[Road of Alchemists]] and, later, to take [[Lok Lambert]], [[Sophie Casterwill]] and [[Cherit]] back to [[Organization Central]]. It was destroyed when Lok summoned [[Baselaird|Powerbonded Baselaird]] inside it, blowing it apart and sending its driver flying. {{source|Chasing Void}}

* '''Black sedan''' – The standard and most frequently seen variant, used by Organization agents all over the globe. 
* '''Grey sedan''' - A grey sedan was used [[DeFoe]] and [[Grier]] prior to their journey to [[Prague]] in pursuit of the Huntik team. {{Source|The Casterwill Client}}
* '''White sedan''' – A unique white variant was used by [[Wilder]] and his team in [[Prague]]. The car was destroyed when [[Lok Lambert]] summoned [[Baselaird|Powerbonded Baselaird]] from inside the vehicle. {{source|Chasing Void}}
